# The abilities an effect gave a permanent are taken by a later "loses all abilities" (CR 613.1f, 613.7), the static ones
# that affect other objects among them. The Irencrag becomes Everflame, Heroes' Legacy and gains equip {3} and "Equipped
# creature gets +3/+3"; equipped to Aunt May it makes her a 3/5. When Bot1 pays to move it to Thraben Inspector, Bot2's
# Tishana's Tidebinder counters the equip ability: Everflame, an artifact, loses all abilities while the Tidebinder stays.
# It is still an Equipment attached to Aunt May (layer 4), but gives her nothing - she is a 0/2 again - and it has no equip
# ability left to activate.

